          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\r\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\r\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\r\n| extend HostId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId)), EdicaoInstancia = tostring(properties.edition)\r\n| join kind=inner (\r\n    resources\r\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\r\n    | extend HostId = tolower(id)\r\n    | distinct HostId\r\n) on HostId\r\n| extend EdicaoInstancia = iff(isempty(EdicaoInstancia), \"Não identificada\", EdicaoInstancia)\r\n| summarize Instancias = count() by EdicaoInstancia\r\n| order by Instancias desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "⚙️ Instâncias por edição reportada",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "piechart",
              "chartSettings": {
                "createOtherGroup": 0,
                "showLegend": true,
                "labelColumn": "EdicaoInstancia",
                "valueColumn": "Instancias"
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "100",
            "name": "instances_by_edition"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "> **Edição por host x edição por instância:** os quatro KPIs de host classificam cada servidor somente pela maior edição encontrada nele, para formar categorias mutuamente exclusivas usadas na análise por host/OSE. O gráfico **Instâncias por edição reportada** conta cada instância separadamente e é a visão comparável ao dashboard nativo do Azure Arc. Por isso, uma instância Evaluation em um host que também possui Enterprise aparece no gráfico de instâncias, enquanto o host permanece classificado como Enterprise. Não some as duas visões."
            },
            "customWidth": "100",
            "name": "edition_scope_note"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "edition_summary_group",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "VisaoGeral"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📡 Qualidade dos dados e confiança da telemetria\r\n\r\nEsta seção resume a confiabilidade dos dados usados no workbook. A extensão SQL não é o foco principal do relatório; ela é usada como sinal de confiança para inventário, `LicenseType`, ESU, edição, versão e cores.\r\n\r\n**Universos separados:** descoberta e cobertura usam máquinas Arc com `properties.detectedProperties.mssqldiscovered = true`, conforme a consulta pública Microsoft. O inventário de instâncias usa os recursos `microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances`. Assim, uma máquina pode ter SQL descoberto antes de suas instâncias aparecerem como recursos registrados.\r\n\r\n**Critério conservador:** uma extensão só conta como **saudável** quando todos os sinais são positivos ao mesmo tempo: máquina Arc `Connected`; provisionamento da máquina `Succeeded`; máquina sem erros reportados; provisionamento da extensão `Succeeded`; mensagem contendo exatamente `SQL Server Extension Agent: Healthy`; `uploadStatus = OK`; e timestamp entre o início do dia de três dias atrás e o início do dia atual. Timestamp ausente, antigo ou futuro é tratado como **com atenção**.\r\n\r\nEsse critério usa a consulta oficial de troubleshooting como base e adiciona provisionamento e erros da máquina para evitar falso saudável. Se qualquer sinal estiver ausente ou ambíguo, a extensão fica **com atenção**. Isso indica menor confiança ou atualidade dos dados, não uma conclusão automática de licenciamento incorreto. Veja o detalhe na aba **Saúde Operacional**."
      },
      "name": "data_quality_confidence_intro",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "VisaoGeral"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| where tostring(properties.detectedProperties.mssqldiscovered) =~ \"true\"\n| summarize Value = count_distinct(tolower(id))\n| extend Metric = \"SQL descoberto pelo Arc\", Detail = \"Máquinas com mssqldiscovered = true\"\n| project Metric, Value, Detail",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "SQL descoberto pelo Arc",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "showBorder": false,
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric"
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12
                },
                "secondaryContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Detail"
                }
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "33",
            "name": "dq_sql_hosts"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| where tostring(properties.detectedProperties.mssqldiscovered) =~ \"true\"\n| extend HostId = tolower(id)\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\"\n    | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n    | where tostring(properties.publisher) =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\"\n    | where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\",\"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\")\n    | extend HostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\")))\n    | distinct HostId\n    | extend HasExt = \"yes\"\n) on HostId\n| summarize Value = count_distinctif(HostId, HasExt == \"yes\")\n| extend Metric = \"Extensões SQL instaladas\", Detail = \"Máquinas com SQL descoberto e extensão SQL\"\n| project Metric, Value, Detail",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Extensões SQL instaladas",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "showBorder": false,
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric"
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12
                },
                "secondaryContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Detail"
                }
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "33",
            "name": "dq_sql_extensions"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| where tostring(properties.detectedProperties.mssqldiscovered) =~ \"true\"\n| extend HostId = tolower(id)\n| join kind=leftouter (resources | where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\" | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup}) | where tostring(properties.publisher) =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\" | where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\",\"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\") | extend HostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\"))) | distinct HostId | extend HasExt = \"yes\") on HostId\n| summarize SQLDiscoveredHosts = count_distinct(HostId), SQLExtensionHosts = count_distinctif(HostId, HasExt == \"yes\")\n| extend Value = SQLDiscoveredHosts - SQLExtensionHosts\n| extend Metric = \"Hosts sem extensão SQL\", Detail = strcat(tostring(SQLExtensionHosts), \" de \", tostring(SQLDiscoveredHosts), \" máquinas com SQL descoberto\")\n| project Metric, Value, Detail",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Hosts sem extensão SQL",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "showBorder": false,
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric"
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12
                },
                "secondaryContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Detail"
                }
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "34",
            "name": "dq_missing_extension"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| where tostring(properties.detectedProperties.mssqldiscovered) =~ \"true\"\n| extend HostId = tolower(id)\n| join kind=leftouter (resources | where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\" | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup}) | where tostring(properties.publisher) =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\" | where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\",\"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\") | extend HostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\"))) | distinct HostId | extend HasExt = \"yes\") on HostId\n| summarize SQLDiscoveredHosts = count_distinct(HostId), SQLExtensionHosts = count_distinctif(HostId, HasExt == \"yes\")\n| extend CoveragePct = iff(SQLDiscoveredHosts == 0, 0.0, round(100.0 * todouble(SQLExtensionHosts) / todouble(SQLDiscoveredHosts), 2))\n| extend Metric = \"Cobertura da extensão SQL (%)\", Value = CoveragePct, Detail = strcat(tostring(SQLExtensionHosts), \" de \", tostring(SQLDiscoveredHosts), \" máquinas com SQL descoberto\")\n| project Metric, Value, Detail",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Cobertura da extensão SQL",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "showBorder": false,
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric"
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12
                },
                "secondaryContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Detail"
                }
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "33",
            "name": "dq_coverage"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\"\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| where tostring(properties.publisher) =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\"\n| where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\",\"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\")\n| extend HostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\")))\n| join kind=inner (\n    resources\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n    | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n    | extend HostId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n    | distinct HostId\n) on HostId\n| extend ExtensionResourceID = tostring(id)\n| extend targetMachineName = tolower(tostring(split(id, \"/\")[8]))\n| extend ExtensionProvisioningState = tostring(properties.provisioningState)\n| extend LicenseType = tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType)\n| extend Message = tostring(properties.instanceView.status.message)\n| extend LastReportedExtensionHealth = iff(Message contains \"SQL Server Extension Agent: Healthy\", \"Healthy\", \"Unhealthy\")\n| extend LastExtensionUploadStatus = iff(Message contains \"uploadStatus : OK\" or Message contains \"uploadStatus: OK\" or Message contains \"uploadStatus:OK\", \"OK\", \"Unhealthy\")\n| extend LastExtensionUploadTimestamp = coalesce(extract(\"timestampUTC : ([0-9]{4}[/-][0-9]{2}[/-][0-9]{2})\", 1, Message), extract(\"timestampUTC: ([0-9]{4}[/-][0-9]{2}[/-][0-9]{2})\", 1, Message))\n| extend LastExtensionUploadDate = todatetime(strcat(replace_string(LastExtensionUploadTimestamp, \"/\", \"-\"), \"T00:00:00Z\"))\n| extend LastUploadOutsideAcceptableRange = isnull(LastExtensionUploadDate) or LastExtensionUploadDate < startofday(ago(3d)) or LastExtensionUploadDate > startofday(now())\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n    | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n    | extend LowerMachineName = tolower(tostring(name))\n    | project MachineId = tostring(id), MachineName = tostring(name), LowerMachineName, MachineStatus = tostring(properties.status), MachineProvisioningStatus = tostring(properties.provisioningState), MachineErrors = tostring(properties.errorDetails), subscriptionId, resourceGroup, TenantID = tenantId\n) on $left.targetMachineName == $right.LowerMachineName, subscriptionId, resourceGroup\n| extend IsHealthy = MachineStatus =~ \"Connected\" and MachineProvisioningStatus =~ \"Succeeded\" and (isempty(MachineErrors) or MachineErrors == \"[]\") and ExtensionProvisioningState =~ \"Succeeded\" and LastReportedExtensionHealth =~ \"Healthy\" and LastExtensionUploadStatus =~ \"OK\" and LastUploadOutsideAcceptableRange == false\n| extend HealthState = iff(IsHealthy, \"Saudável\", \"Com atenção\")\n| extend FailureReasons = strcat(\n    iif(MachineStatus !~ \"Connected\", strcat(\"Status da máquina: \", MachineStatus, \"; \"), \"\"),\n    iif(MachineProvisioningStatus !~ \"Succeeded\", strcat(\"Estado de provisionamento da máquina: \", MachineProvisioningStatus, \"; \"), \"\"),\n    iif(isnotempty(MachineErrors) and MachineErrors != \"[]\", \"Máquina reporta erros; \", \"\"),\n    iif(LastReportedExtensionHealth !~ \"Healthy\", \"Extensão reportada como não saudável; \", \"\"),\n    iif(LastUploadOutsideAcceptableRange, \"Último upload fora da janela aceitável; \", \"\"),\n    iif(LastExtensionUploadStatus !~ \"OK\", \"Status de upload diferente de OK; \", \"\"),\n    iif(ExtensionProvisioningState !~ \"Succeeded\", strcat(\"Estado de provisionamento da extensão: \", ExtensionProvisioningState, \"; \"), \"\")\n)\n| extend RecommendedAction = case(\n    MachineStatus =~ \"Disconnected\", \"Reconecte a máquina Azure Arc e valide a conectividade do agente.\",\n    MachineStatus =~ \"Expired\", \"Renove ou repare o certificado da máquina Azure Arc e reconecte a máquina.\",\n    MachineProvisioningStatus !~ \"Succeeded\", \"Valide o estado de provisionamento da máquina Azure Arc.\",\n    isnotempty(MachineErrors) and MachineErrors != \"[]\", \"Revise e resolva os erros reportados pela máquina Azure Arc.\",\n    ExtensionProvisioningState !~ \"Succeeded\", \"Valide o estado de provisionamento da extensão SQL.\",\n    LastExtensionUploadStatus !~ \"OK\", \"Revise a mensagem de status da extensão SQL, a conectividade com o DPS e os logs da extensão.\",\n    LastUploadOutsideAcceptableRange, \"Valide se a extensão ainda envia dados de inventário e cobrança.\",\n    LastReportedExtensionHealth !~ \"Healthy\", \"Revise a mensagem de status da extensão SQL e os motivos da falha.\",\n    \"Nenhuma ação imediata indicada por este sinal do workbook.\"\n)\n| project MachineName, MachineStatus, HealthState, LastReportedExtensionHealth, LastExtensionUploadStatus, LastExtensionUploadTimestamp, LicenseType, ExtensionProvisioningState, RecommendedAction, FailureReasons, SubscriptionID = subscriptionId, ResourceGroup = resourceGroup, ExtensionResourceID, MachineId\n| order by HealthState desc, MachineName asc\n| summarize Value = countif(HealthState == \"Saudável\")\n| extend Metric = \"Extensões SQL saudáveis\", Detail = \"Sinal de confiança dos dados reportados\"\n| project Metric, Value, Detail",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Extensões SQL saudáveis",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "showBorder": false,
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric"
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12
                },
                "secondaryContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Detail"
                }
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "33",
            "name": "dq_healthy_extensions"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\"\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| where tostring(properties.publisher) =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\"\n| where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\",\"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\")\n| extend HostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\")))\n| join kind=inner (\n    resources\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n    | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n    | extend HostId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n    | distinct HostId\n) on HostId\n| extend ExtensionResourceID = tostring(id)\n| extend targetMachineName = tolower(tostring(split(id, \"/\")[8]))\n| extend ExtensionProvisioningState = tostring(properties.provisioningState)\n| extend LicenseType = tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType)\n| extend Message = tostring(properties.instanceView.status.message)\n| extend LastReportedExtensionHealth = iff(Message contains \"SQL Server Extension Agent: Healthy\", \"Healthy\", \"Unhealthy\")\n| extend LastExtensionUploadStatus = iff(Message contains \"uploadStatus : OK\" or Message contains \"uploadStatus: OK\" or Message contains \"uploadStatus:OK\", \"OK\", \"Unhealthy\")\n| extend LastExtensionUploadTimestamp = coalesce(extract(\"timestampUTC : ([0-9]{4}[/-][0-9]{2}[/-][0-9]{2})\", 1, Message), extract(\"timestampUTC: ([0-9]{4}[/-][0-9]{2}[/-][0-9]{2})\", 1, Message))\n| extend LastExtensionUploadDate = todatetime(strcat(replace_string(LastExtensionUploadTimestamp, \"/\", \"-\"), \"T00:00:00Z\"))\n| extend LastUploadOutsideAcceptableRange = isnull(LastExtensionUploadDate) or LastExtensionUploadDate < startofday(ago(3d)) or LastExtensionUploadDate > startofday(now())\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n    | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n    | extend LowerMachineName = tolower(tostring(name))\n    | project MachineId = tostring(id), MachineName = tostring(name), LowerMachineName, MachineStatus = tostring(properties.status), MachineProvisioningStatus = tostring(properties.provisioningState), MachineErrors = tostring(properties.errorDetails), subscriptionId, resourceGroup, TenantID = tenantId\n) on $left.targetMachineName == $right.LowerMachineName, subscriptionId, resourceGroup\n| extend IsHealthy = MachineStatus =~ \"Connected\" and MachineProvisioningStatus =~ \"Succeeded\" and (isempty(MachineErrors) or MachineErrors == \"[]\") and ExtensionProvisioningState =~ \"Succeeded\" and LastReportedExtensionHealth =~ \"Healthy\" and LastExtensionUploadStatus =~ \"OK\" and LastUploadOutsideAcceptableRange == false\n| extend HealthState = iff(IsHealthy, \"Saudável\", \"Com atenção\")\n| extend FailureReasons = strcat(\n    iif(MachineStatus !~ \"Connected\", strcat(\"Status da máquina: \", MachineStatus, \"; \"), \"\"),\n    iif(MachineProvisioningStatus !~ \"Succeeded\", strcat(\"Estado de provisionamento da máquina: \", MachineProvisioningStatus, \"; \"), \"\"),\n    iif(isnotempty(MachineErrors) and MachineErrors != \"[]\", \"Máquina reporta erros; \", \"\"),\n    iif(LastReportedExtensionHealth !~ \"Healthy\", \"Extensão reportada como não saudável; \", \"\"),\n    iif(LastUploadOutsideAcceptableRange, \"Último upload fora da janela aceitável; \", \"\"),\n    iif(LastExtensionUploadStatus !~ \"OK\", \"Status de upload diferente de OK; \", \"\"),\n    iif(ExtensionProvisioningState !~ \"Succeeded\", strcat(\"Estado de provisionamento da extensão: \", ExtensionProvisioningState, \"; \"), \"\")\n)\n| extend RecommendedAction = case(\n    MachineStatus =~ \"Disconnected\", \"Reconecte a máquina Azure Arc e valide a conectividade do agente.\",\n    MachineStatus =~ \"Expired\", \"Renove ou repare o certificado da máquina Azure Arc e reconecte a máquina.\",\n    MachineProvisioningStatus !~ \"Succeeded\", \"Valide o estado de provisionamento da máquina Azure Arc.\",\n    isnotempty(MachineErrors) and MachineErrors != \"[]\", \"Revise e resolva os erros reportados pela máquina Azure Arc.\",\n    ExtensionProvisioningState !~ \"Succeeded\", \"Valide o estado de provisionamento da extensão SQL.\",\n    LastExtensionUploadStatus !~ \"OK\", \"Revise a mensagem de status da extensão SQL, a conectividade com o DPS e os logs da extensão.\",\n    LastUploadOutsideAcceptableRange, \"Valide se a extensão ainda envia dados de inventário e cobrança.\",\n    LastReportedExtensionHealth !~ \"Healthy\", \"Revise a mensagem de status da extensão SQL e os motivos da falha.\",\n    \"Nenhuma ação imediata indicada por este sinal do workbook.\"\n)\n| project MachineName, MachineStatus, HealthState, LastReportedExtensionHealth, LastExtensionUploadStatus, LastExtensionUploadTimestamp, LicenseType, ExtensionProvisioningState, RecommendedAction, FailureReasons, SubscriptionID = subscriptionId, ResourceGroup = resourceGroup, ExtensionResourceID, MachineId\n| order by HealthState desc, MachineName asc\n| summarize Value = countif(HealthState != \"Saudável\")\n| extend Metric = \"Extensões SQL com atenção\", Detail = \"Indica risco de dados incompletos ou desatualizados\"\n| project Metric, Value, Detail",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Extensões SQL com atenção",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "showBorder": false,
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric"
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12
                },
                "secondaryContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Detail"
                }
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "34",
            "name": "dq_unhealthy_extensions"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "data_quality_confidence_group",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "VisaoGeral"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n### Separação obrigatória das informações\n\n#### Camada 1 - Azure Arc: dados reportados\n- Hosts, instâncias, edição, versão, `properties.vCore`, estado da máquina e telemetria são valores observados nos recursos do Azure Resource Graph.\n- `LicenseType = Paid / PAYG / LicenseOnly` e `enableExtendedSecurityUpdates` são **configurações reportadas** pela Azure Extension for SQL Server. Esses valores não comprovam direito contratual, Software Assurance, subscrição SQL, SPLA, Azure Hybrid Benefit, cobrança ou conformidade.\n\n#### Camada 2 - estimativa técnica de licenciamento\n- **Estimativa técnica: cores por host/OSE** é um cálculo customizado, consolidado por host para evitar multiplicar cores quando há várias instâncias no mesmo OSE.\n- A estimativa usa propriedades reportadas pelo Arc como insumo, mas o resultado não é uma propriedade nativa do Azure Arc, um medidor de billing, uma fatura, entitlement ou posição SAM.\n- A análise detalhada e suas premissas ficam na aba **Estimativa técnica de licenciamento**.\n\n> `properties.vCore` é reportado por instância SQL Server; a estimativa de cores é calculada por host/OSE. Portanto, os totais não são comparáveis 1:1."
      },
      "name": "concept_note",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "VisaoGeral"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n### SQL Server 2016 e SQL Server ESU\nO FAQ público de SQL Server Extended Security Updates informa que **SQL Server 2016** tem fim do suporte estendido em **14 de julho de 2026**, com **ESU Year 1** de **15 de julho de 2026** até **13 de julho de 2027**, Year 2 até **18 de julho de 2028** e Year 3 até **17 de julho de 2029**. O mesmo FAQ descreve ESU como opção temporária e informa que SQL Server ESU inclui somente atualizações de segurança **Critical**. Este workbook identifica instâncias Windows Enterprise/Standard SQL Server 2014/2016 e só as inclui nos indicadores de qualificação técnica quando a extensão também reporta `LicenseType` como `Paid` ou `PAYG`. O estado ESU exibido vem de `enableExtendedSecurityUpdates`; ele não comprova contrato, cobrança ou entrega efetiva de atualizações."
      },
      "name": "sql2016_esu_note",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "VisaoGeral"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n## 📈 Distribuição Visual de SQL Server\n**Estado operacional de hosts SQL e distribuição por LicenseType da extensão SQL Server.**"
      },
      "name": "pie_header",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "VisaoGeral"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n| extend joinId = tolower(id)\n| join kind=inner (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n    | extend arcMachineId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n    | distinct arcMachineId\n) on $left.joinId == $right.arcMachineId\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| extend status = case(tolower(properties.status) == \"connected\", \"Connected\", tolower(properties.status) == \"disconnected\", \"Offline\", tolower(properties.status) == \"error\", \"Error\", tolower(properties.status) == \"expired\", \"Expired\", \"Unknown\")\n| summarize Hosts = count_distinct(joinId) by status",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "🔍 Status operacional dos hosts SQL",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "piechart",
              "chartSettings": {
                "createOtherGroup": 0,
                "showLegend": true,
                "labelColumn": "status",
                "valueColumn": "Hosts"
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "status_pie"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\"\n| where properties.publisher =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\"\n| where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\", \"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\")\n| extend hostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\")))\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| join kind=inner (\n    resources\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n    | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n    | extend hostId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n    | distinct hostId\n) on hostId\n| join kind=inner (\n    resources\n    | where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n    | extend hostId = tolower(id)\n    | distinct hostId\n) on hostId| extend licenseTypeRaw = tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType)\n| extend LicenseType = case(licenseTypeRaw == \"PAYG\", \"PAYG\", licenseTypeRaw == \"Paid\", \"Paid\", licenseTypeRaw == \"LicenseOnly\", \"LicenseOnly\", isempty(licenseTypeRaw), \"Pendente\", licenseTypeRaw)\n| summarize Hosts = count_distinct(hostId) by LicenseType\n| order by Hosts desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "📊 Configuração LicenseType reportada pelo Azure Arc",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "piechart",
              "chartSettings": {
                "createOtherGroup": 0,
                "showLegend": true,
                "labelColumn": "LicenseType",
                "valueColumn": "Hosts"
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "license_pie"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "pie_group",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "VisaoGeral"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n## 🧾 Estimativa técnica de licenciamento - camada derivada\n**Esta aba não apresenta fatos de licenciamento comprovado. Ela calcula cenários auxiliares por host/OSE a partir de dados reportados pelo Azure Arc.**\n\n> **Dados de entrada reportados pelo Arc:** máquina, conectividade, núcleos lógicos/físicos, instâncias, edição, versão, `LicenseType`, HA/DR e configuração ESU.\n>\n> **Resultados customizados:** maior edição por host, classificação por host/OSE, mínimo de 4 cores e totais estimados por configuração. Esses resultados não são medidores de billing, fatura, entitlement, auditoria ou comprovação de conformidade. A posição oficial deve ser validada em Product Terms, contratos aplicáveis, Azure Cost Management e fontes oficiais de licenciamento/billing."
      },
      "name": "trueup_header",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Licenciamento"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Visão baseada na consulta pública de hosts conectados\n\nEsta visão segue os critérios centrais da consulta pública Microsoft: máquina Arc `Connected`, extensão SQL instalada, edição Enterprise/Standard e pelo menos uma instância cujo `properties.licenseType` não seja `HADR`. A contagem usa os núcleos detectados (`logicalCoreCount` para VM e `coreCount` para físico), sem aplicar o mínimo customizado de 4 cores nem o limite técnico de 24 cores da edição Standard."
            },
            "customWidth": "100",
            "name": "official_billable_intro"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| where tostring(properties.status) =~ \"Connected\"\n| extend HostId = tolower(id)\n| extend Manufacturer = tostring(properties.detectedProperties.manufacturer), Model = tostring(properties.detectedProperties.model)\n| extend VMbyManufacturer = Manufacturer contains_cs \"VMware\" or Manufacturer contains_cs \"QEMU\" or Manufacturer contains_cs \"Amazon EC2\" or Manufacturer contains_cs \"OpenStack\" or Manufacturer contains_cs \"Hetzner\" or Manufacturer contains_cs \"Mission Critical Cloud\" or Manufacturer contains_cs \"DigitalOcean\" or Manufacturer contains_cs \"UpCloud\" or Manufacturer contains_cs \"oVirt\" or Manufacturer contains_cs \"Alibaba\" or Manufacturer contains_cs \"KubeVirt\" or Manufacturer contains_cs \"Parallels\" or Manufacturer contains_cs \"Bochs\" or Manufacturer contains_cs \"XEN\"\n| extend VMbyModel = Model contains_cs \"OpenStack\" or Model contains_cs \"Droplet\" or Model contains_cs \"oVirt\" or Model contains_cs \"Hypervisor\" or Model contains_cs \"Virtual\" or Model contains_cs \"BHYVE\" or Model contains_cs \"KVM\"\n| extend GoogleVM = Manufacturer contains_cs \"Google\" and Model contains_cs \"Google Compute Engine\", NutanixVM = Manufacturer contains_cs \"Nutanix\" and Model contains_cs \"AHV\", MicrosoftVM = Manufacturer contains_cs \"Microsoft Corporation\" and Model contains_cs \"Virtual Machine\"\n| extend IsVM = VMbyManufacturer or VMbyModel or GoogleVM or NutanixVM or MicrosoftVM\n| extend BillableCores = toint(iff(IsVM, properties.detectedProperties.logicalCoreCount, properties.detectedProperties.coreCount))\n| join kind=inner (resources | where type =~ \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\" | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup}) | where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\",\"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\") | extend HostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\"))) | distinct HostId) on HostId\n| join kind=inner (resources | where type =~ \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\" | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup}) | where tostring(properties.edition) in~ (\"Enterprise\",\"Standard\") | where tostring(properties.licenseType) !~ \"HADR\" | extend HostId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId)) | project HostId) on HostId\n| summarize BillableCores = max(BillableCores) by HostId\n| summarize HostsConectados = count_distinct(HostId), CoresDetectados = sum(BillableCores)\n| extend Metric = \"Cores detectados em hosts conectados\", Detail = strcat(tostring(HostsConectados), \" hosts Enterprise/Standard ativos\")\n| project Metric, CoresDetectados, Detail",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Consulta pública Microsoft: conectados e não HADR",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "showBorder": true,
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric"
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "CoresDetectados",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "blue"
                  }
                },
                "secondaryContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Detail"
                }
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "100",
            "name": "official_connected_billable"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "official_billable_group",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Licenciamento"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\"\n| where properties.publisher =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\"\n| where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\", \"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\")\n| extend hostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\")))\n| extend licenseTypeRaw = tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType)\n| extend esuRaw = tostring(properties.settings.enableExtendedSecurityUpdates)\n| extend extState = tostring(properties.provisioningState)\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| project hostId, licenseTypeRaw, esuRaw, extState\n| join kind=inner (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n    | extend hostId = tolower(id)\n    | extend logicalCores = toint(properties.detectedProperties.logicalCoreCount)\n    | extend physicalCores = toint(properties.detectedProperties.coreCount)\n    | extend manufacturer = tostring(properties.detectedProperties.manufacturer)\n    | extend model = tostring(properties.detectedProperties.model)\n    | extend VMbyManufacturer = manufacturer contains_cs \"VMware\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"QEMU\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"Amazon EC2\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"OpenStack\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"Hetzner\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"Mission Critical Cloud\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"DigitalOcean\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"UpCloud\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"oVirt\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"Alibaba\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"KubeVirt\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"Parallels\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"Bochs\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"XEN\"\n    | extend VMbyModel = model contains_cs \"OpenStack\" or model contains_cs \"Droplet\" or model contains_cs \"oVirt\" or model contains_cs \"Hypervisor\" or model contains_cs \"Virtual\" or model contains_cs \"BHYVE\" or model contains_cs \"KVM\"\n    | extend GoogleVM = manufacturer contains_cs \"Google\" and model contains_cs \"Google Compute Engine\"\n    | extend NutanixVM = manufacturer contains_cs \"Nutanix\" and model contains_cs \"AHV\"\n    | extend MicrosoftVM = manufacturer contains_cs \"Microsoft Corporation\" and model contains_cs \"Virtual Machine\"\n    | extend isVM = VMbyManufacturer or VMbyModel or GoogleVM or NutanixVM or MicrosoftVM\n    | project hostId, machineName = name, logicalCores, physicalCores, manufacturer, model, isVM\n) on hostId\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n    | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n    | extend hostId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n    | extend edition = tostring(properties.edition)\n    | extend instLicType = tostring(properties.licenseType)\n    | extend sqlVersion = tostring(properties.version)\n    | extend SQLVersionMajor = case(sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2014\" or sqlVersion startswith \"12.\", \"SQL Server 2014\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2016\" or sqlVersion startswith \"13.\", \"SQL Server 2016\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2017\" or sqlVersion startswith \"14.\", \"SQL Server 2017\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2019\" or sqlVersion startswith \"15.\", \"SQL Server 2019\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2022\" or sqlVersion startswith \"16.\", \"SQL Server 2022\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2025\" or sqlVersion startswith \"17.\", \"SQL Server 2025\", isnotempty(sqlVersion), sqlVersion, \"Não identificado\")\n    | extend isSQLServerESUVersion = SQLVersionMajor in (\"SQL Server 2014\", \"SQL Server 2016\")\n    | extend editionRank = case(edition has \"Enterprise\", 6, edition has \"Standard\", 5, edition has \"Web\", 4, edition has \"Express\", 3, edition has \"Developer\", 2, edition has \"Evaluation\", 1, 0)\n    | summarize topRank = max(editionRank), ativos = countif(instLicType !~ \"HADR\"), qtdSQLServerESU = countif(isSQLServerESUVersion), versoesSQL = make_set(SQLVersionMajor, 20) by hostId\n) on hostId\n| extend topEdition = case(topRank == 6, \"Enterprise\", topRank == 5, \"Standard\", topRank == 4, \"Web\", topRank == 3, \"Express\", topRank == 2, \"Developer\", topRank == 1, \"Evaluation\", \"Sem instância\")\n| extend ed3 = case(topEdition == \"Enterprise\", \"Ent\", topEdition == \"Standard\", \"Std\", topEdition == \"Web\", \"Web\", topEdition == \"Express\", \"Exp\", topEdition)\n| extend isFreeEdition = topEdition in (\"Developer\", \"Evaluation\", \"Express\")\n| extend isPassivo = (topRank > 0 and ativos == 0)\n| extend hasSQLServerESUVersion = qtdSQLServerESU > 0\n| extend coresDetectados = iff(isVM, logicalCores, physicalCores)\n| extend coresHostBase = iff(coalesce(coresDetectados, 0) < 4, 4, coresDetectados)\n| extend coresHost = iff(topEdition == \"Standard\" and coresHostBase > 24, 24, coresHostBase)\n| extend coresLicencaEstimados = case(topEdition == \"Sem instância\", 0, isFreeEdition, 0, isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), 0, isempty(licenseTypeRaw), 0, coresHost)\n| extend coresPAYG = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"PAYG\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresPaid = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"Paid\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresLicenseOnlyComLicenciamento = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"LicenseOnly\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresRZero = case(isFreeEdition, coresHost, isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), coresHost, 0)\n| summarize CoresPAYG = sum(coresPAYG)",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "🧮 Estimativa de cores em hosts configurados PAYG",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "CoresPAYG",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "red"
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": true,
                "size": "small"
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "20",
            "name": "trueup_payg"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\"\n| where properties.publisher =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\"\n| where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\", \"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\")\n| extend hostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\")))\n| extend licenseTypeRaw = tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType)\n| extend esuRaw = tostring(properties.settings.enableExtendedSecurityUpdates)\n| extend extState = tostring(properties.provisioningState)\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| project hostId, licenseTypeRaw, esuRaw, extState\n| join kind=inner (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n    | extend hostId = tolower(id)\n    | extend logicalCores = toint(properties.detectedProperties.logicalCoreCount)\n    | extend physicalCores = toint(properties.detectedProperties.coreCount)\n    | extend manufacturer = tostring(properties.detectedProperties.manufacturer)\n    | extend model = tostring(properties.detectedProperties.model)\n    | extend VMbyManufacturer = manufacturer contains_cs \"VMware\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"QEMU\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"Amazon EC2\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"OpenStack\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"Hetzner\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"Mission Critical Cloud\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"DigitalOcean\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"UpCloud\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"oVirt\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"Alibaba\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"KubeVirt\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"Parallels\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"Bochs\" or manufacturer contains_cs \"XEN\"\n    | extend VMbyModel = model contains_cs \"OpenStack\" or model contains_cs \"Droplet\" or model contains_cs \"oVirt\" or model contains_cs \"Hypervisor\" or model contains_cs \"Virtual\" or model contains_cs \"BHYVE\" or model contains_cs \"KVM\"\n    | extend GoogleVM = manufacturer contains_cs \"Google\" and model contains_cs \"Google Compute Engine\"\n    | extend NutanixVM = manufacturer contains_cs \"Nutanix\" and model contains_cs \"AHV\"\n    | extend MicrosoftVM = manufacturer contains_cs \"Microsoft Corporation\" and model contains_cs \"Virtual Machine\"\n    | extend isVM = VMbyManufacturer or VMbyModel or GoogleVM or NutanixVM or MicrosoftVM\n    | project hostId, machineName = name, logicalCores, physicalCores, manufacturer, model, isVM\n) on hostId\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n    | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n    | extend hostId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n    | extend edition = tostring(properties.edition)\n    | extend instLicType = tostring(properties.licenseType)\n    | extend sqlVersion = tostring(properties.version)\n    | extend SQLVersionMajor = case(sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2014\" or sqlVersion startswith \"12.\", \"SQL Server 2014\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2016\" or sqlVersion startswith \"13.\", \"SQL Server 2016\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2017\" or sqlVersion startswith \"14.\", \"SQL Server 2017\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2019\" or sqlVersion startswith \"15.\", \"SQL Server 2019\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2022\" or sqlVersion startswith \"16.\", \"SQL Server 2022\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2025\" or sqlVersion startswith \"17.\", \"SQL Server 2025\", isnotempty(sqlVersion), sqlVersion, \"Não identificado\")\n    | extend isSQLServerESUVersion = SQLVersionMajor in (\"SQL Server 2014\", \"SQL Server 2016\")\n    | extend editionRank = case(edition has \"Enterprise\", 6, edition has \"Standard\", 5, edition has \"Web\", 4, edition has \"Express\", 3, edition has \"Developer\", 2, edition has \"Evaluation\", 1, 0)\n    | summarize topRank = max(editionRank), ativos = countif(instLicType !~ \"HADR\"), qtdSQLServerESU = countif(isSQLServerESUVersion), versoesSQL = make_set(SQLVersionMajor, 20) by hostId\n) on hostId\n| extend topEdition = case(topRank == 6, \"Enterprise\", topRank == 5, \"Standard\", topRank == 4, \"Web\", topRank == 3, \"Express\", topRank == 2, \"Developer\", topRank == 1, \"Evaluation\", \"Sem instância\")\n| extend ed3 = case(topEdition == \"Enterprise\", \"Ent\", topEdition == \"Standard\", \"Std\", topEdition == \"Web\", \"Web\", topEdition == \"Express\", \"Exp\", topEdition)\n| extend isFreeEdition = topEdition in (\"Developer\", \"Evaluation\", \"Express\")\n| extend isPassivo = (topRank > 0 and ativos == 0)\n| extend hasSQLServerESUVersion = qtdSQLServerESU > 0\n| extend coresDetectados = iff(isVM, logicalCores, physicalCores)\n| extend coresHostBase = iff(coalesce(coresDetectados, 0) < 4, 4, coresDetectados)\n| extend coresHost = iff(topEdition == \"Standard\" and coresHostBase > 24, 24, coresHostBase)\n| extend coresLicencaEstimados = case(topEdition == \"Sem instância\", 0, isFreeEdition, 0, isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), 0, isempty(licenseTypeRaw), 0, coresHost)\n| extend coresPAYG = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"PAYG\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresPaid = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"Paid\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresLicenseOnlyComLicenciamento = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"LicenseOnly\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresRZero = case(isFreeEdition, coresHost, isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), coresHost, 0)\n| summarize CoresRZero = sum(coresRZero)",
              "size": 4,
